系欢迎全国优秀大学生报名夏季交流营活动。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqKmGicaEQvogg6s6q1BDr4WBAfibetZWF246RicxuLoAhBFuSicjicWXSt792D4CGdRYgzmrJmUCs2VXsIcVGhibRVDHjZIJys0N7ln8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>一、报名对象</span></span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>全国高校本科三年级在校生（</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>届本科毕业生），可获得免推资格的本科生优先考虑；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>学业成绩优秀，英语水平良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚且成果突出，有较强的创新意识和创新能力者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>此次交流营招收的营员专业背景包括且不限于</span></span></span><span><span><span>化学</span></span></span><span><span><span>专业，专业为生物、材料、物理、药学等相关领域的同学均欢迎报名参加。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqK3AzToq2OvJ6RQwg1eTwBmiaECgundpdbIWbTWhWWKND10vKR3KaWS5gBckxRzPZcFldwuOp9FWLxbHdDY3ibd6p5p90GGjRkpM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>二、活动安排</span></span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>开营仪式、</span></span></span><span><span><span>课题组互动市集（每位营员一张可探索的</span></span><span><span>“科研地图”，营员化身“科学寻宝者”，通过完成任务解锁个人专属科研兴趣图谱）</span></span></span><span><span><span>等</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>活动时间：</span></span><span><span>预计</span><span><span>2026</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月19-21</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>*</span></span><span><span>活动安排</span></span></span><span><span>以最终公布为准，请大家持续关注；营员须按要求全程准时参加活动。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqI1Uw3zp3ZJSApKuBo0e32sNibJTy6f7d1XVt3jTrLuG2EWlydZjd7AN67eFIdfmkw8aFJb0ibvmPxaw1MZG1QMgwqsuWw1ia0jJk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>3</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>三、申请办法</span></span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>1. </span></span><span>报名时间：即日起</span><span><span>- 6</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>25</span></span><span>日止</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>2. </span></span><span>报名方式：申请人登陆南科大交流营网上报名系统注册登录，并按要求提供本人各项真实信息。网址：</span><span><span>https://yzbm.sustech.edu.cn/</span></span><span>（建议使用</span><span><span>Chrome</span></span><span>或</span><span><span>360</span></span><span>极速浏览器）</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>需上传以下材料：</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>）身份证正反面复印件或照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>）学生证复印件或照片；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）包含所修全部课程的正式成绩单（院系或教务处加盖公章）；成绩单上所标注所在专业的成绩排名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>4</span></span><span>）其他能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料（其他体现个人学术水平、综合能力的证明材料（包括但不限于英语水平证书、论文首页及奖状证书等）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>）交流营报名申请表（签字版）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）个人介绍海报一份（点击原文，模板见化学系官网）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqJ0PjNIEg9m9gkmqhElH1L0CJic8fLzz5NJfmuodPiaBY2WBPzfoccxMmKyp1v01I8lXe2lEsuCRoeSNDB3FEwKLqGQpOval5m1g/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>4</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span><span>四、资格审核</span></span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>交流营评审工作小组将对学生的申请材料进行审核，通过资格审核者将通过电子邮件或电话告知，并以电子邮件通知公布。未通过审核者不作另外通知。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqIul8p8tzMiaxpAOcxPxWmu7dCxLvq4hmXXkXG4eeNY0AnicY8vX59CMdSeKajGa4bJe9FMqrGVFlexPwDFAC3EicGSl0yyKWvfoU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>5</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span>五、联系我们</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>以“夏季交流营咨询”为主题发邮件至：</span></span></p><p><span><span>chem.yzb@sustech.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>对化学系夏季交流营有意向的同学，请加入官方</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群，以便获取最新资讯，入群请备注：姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>学校</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>专业。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pzLrtw4vAqK2gd9V8vicq2sJAnsbvHRdiaUsvtmsR1vOYo59UvkBICNmO0bhkHaLmLQIFdmeXbbwgIwPGprjWB1gAZl5yLrlXeaKfh3v9WZBw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><span><span>请加入官方</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群</span></span></span></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqI7JNcybHoHVxPDJ839SWI84Rzsnav0cacbBfHw4WxLk7Sv02CzHO6LIx0YCKEmcFTcQPwPPzLmmsC3xFkrYVC9GVB9Oh3TGVU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>南方科技大学</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><span> 学校介绍</span></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/pzLrtw4vAqJPtE2zUXibY3cEAGVRszS0TEmJDiceKPTHt9ff64grtMicWbCL23cJVwttp1k3XwSQHxDYYJ2IgFPnhIB5pKzAgrwWu4ywWQBQZM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>南方科技大学（简称：南科大）是深圳在中国高等教育改革发展的时代背景下创建的一所高起点、高定位的公办新型研究型大学。</span></span><span><span>2022</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>日，教育部等三部委公布第二轮“双一流”建设高校及建设学科名单，南方科技大学及数学学科入选“双一流”建设高校及建设学科名单。学校借鉴世界一流理工科大学的学科设置和办学模式，以理、工、医为主，兼具商科和特色人文社科的学科体系，在本科、硕士、博士层次办学，在一系列新的学科方向上开展研究，使学校成为引领社会发展的思想库和新知识、新技术的源泉。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>南方科技大学扎根中国大地，紧抓粤港澳大湾区、深圳先行示范区“双区”驱动，深圳经济特区、深圳先行示范区“双区”叠加的历史机遇，发扬“敢闯敢试、求真务实、改革创新、追求卓越”的创校精神，突出“创知、创新、创业”的办学特色，践行“明德求是、日新自强”的校训精神，努力服务创新型国家建设及深圳国际化现代化创新型城市建设，快速建设成为聚集一流师资、培养拔尖创新人才、创造国际一流学术成果并推动科技应用的国际化高水平研究型大学，为尽早实现建成世界一流研究型大学的宏伟目标打下坚实基础。</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><p><span><strong><span><span>南科大化学系简介：</span></span></strong></span></p></strong></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>PART </span></strong><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>2</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>南方科技大学化学系成立于</span></span><span><span>2011</span></span><span><span>年，为学校最早设立的五个学科之一。秉承“敢闯敢试、求真务实、改革创新、追求卓越”的南科精神，经过十余载耕耘，化学学科建设已逐步迈入正轨。</span></span><span><span>2016</span></span><span><span>年入选广东省攀峰重点学科；</span></span><span><span>2018</span></span><span><span>年化学硕士点获批；同年首次进入</span></span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span>化学学科全球排名</span></span><span><span>1%</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>2020</span></span><span><span>年获批广东省催化化学重点实验室；</span></span><span><span>2021</span></span><span><span>年获批化学一级学科博士点，并入选广东省一流本科专业建设名单；</span></span><span><span>2022</span></span><span><span>年入选国家一流本科专业建设名单；</span></span><span><span>2023</span></span><span><span>年获批国家化学一级学科博士后流动站；</span></span><span><span>2024</span></span><span><span>年获批广东省催化化学基础学科研究中心（广东省首批，化学学科唯一入选单位）。目前，化学学科已进入</span></span><span><span>ESI</span></span><span><span>全球前</span></span><span><span>0.523</span></span><span><span>‰行列，学科自然指数（</span></span><span><span>Nature Index</span></span><span><span>）世界机构排名第</span></span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span>位，泰晤士中国最好学科连续三年（</span></span><span><span>2022-2024</span></span><span><span>）入选</span></span><span><span>A+</span></span><span><span>学科。</span></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>化学系招生导师名单及联系方式见化学系官网：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>https://chem.sustech.edu.cn/?l=zh-cn#/home</span></span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pzLrtw4vAqJw10ABrTcOjicDeye7CFFRsBMOVb4ZhZJQgwhkz3kUTA0OvOD1h5UWfXIdA9DBibqjRgcGn7rAnNnlPG1YqegYAr7jkGW0jZLws/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b92ff2c0a785c5dc7cc2d7e84e38c0a29839c9fb1dceb3c5e02f5e787254946f","textLength":1849,"sourceSha256":"eebbdd3743f80748d85beba1c1eb2170ea6947c03925fb2711fdcb54ddae5605","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fd4adf510097fb2e3ab6","title":"2026年南方科技大学化学系2026年全国优秀大学生夏季交流营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:16.333802+00:00"}
